{"id":2237,"date":"2024-09-19T12:31:47","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:31:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2237"},"modified":"2025-10-02T10:30:04","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T10:30:04","slug":"black-cardboard-boxes","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/black-cardboard-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"Black Cardboard Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2>Coating Options to Enhance the Look of Black Boxes<\/h2>\n<p>We at <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\"><strong><em>Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/em><\/strong><\/a> provide custom <strong>black cardboard boxes<\/strong> made for product packaging, retail display, shipping, and gifting. Whether you&#8217;re packaging luxury items, tech accessories, baked goods, or promotional kits, our black boxes help deliver a sleek and clean presentation.<\/p>\n<p>From <strong>black cardboard packaging<\/strong> for retail shelves to <strong>black cardboard shipping box<\/strong> styles for logistics, we support all your packaging requirements with full customization. Choose from multiple sizes, coatings, and box types\u2014delivered fast, and at wholesale rates.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Clean Designs for Premium and Everyday Packaging<\/h2>\n<h3>Suitable for Retail, Shipping, and Events<\/h3>\n<p>Black packaging adds structure and professionalism to product presentation. Our boxes are used by beauty brands, fashion companies, gourmet food sellers, and eCommerce stores that value consistent branding.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Great for electronics, apparel, accessories, and candles<\/li>\n<li>Flat black or printed options available<\/li>\n<li>Suitable for display, transport, or direct mailing<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>We produce <strong>black carton box<\/strong> designs for both rigid and foldable formats. Boxes are delivered flat-packed, ready for quick assembly with clean, sharp folds.<\/p>\n<h3>Custom Finishing Available<\/h3>\n<p>Make your black packaging stand out with coating options that not only protect but also create contrast and texture.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gloss coating for a sharp, high-shine look<\/li>\n<li>Matte coating for a smooth, low-reflection surface<\/li>\n<li>Spot UV to highlight logos or design details<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Coatings can be applied on exterior panels or interior flaps, depending on your design goals.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2><\/h2>\n<table style=\"height: 354px;\" width=\"901\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Description<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Box Sizes<\/td>\n<td>Fully Custom (Small to Large black cardboard boxes)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Options<\/td>\n<td>Corrugated E-Flute, Kraft, White SBS, Bux Board<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Printing Methods<\/td>\n<td>CMYK, PMS, Foil Stamping, Embossing, Inside Printing<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Coating Options<\/td>\n<td>Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Closure Styles<\/td>\n<td>Tuck End, Mailer, Seal End, Two-Piece Lid and Base<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Inserts Available<\/td>\n<td>Foam, Paperboard, Divider Partitions<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Food Safe Options<\/td>\n<td>Available for black cardboard boxes for food<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MOQ<\/td>\n<td>Starting at 100 Units<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Turnaround Time<\/td>\n<td>4\u20136 Business Days (Rush Orders Available)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shipping<\/td>\n<td>Free Nationwide Shipping<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Design Assistance<\/td>\n<td>Free Layout and Proofing Support<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>More Than Just Black Cardboard Packaging<\/h2>\n<h3>Options for Food and Retail Use<\/h3>\n<p>Many of our clients request <strong>black cardboard boxes for food<\/strong>, especially for baked items, chocolates, or subscription snack kits. These can include die-cut windows, food-safe coatings, and internal compartments.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Available with tuck flaps or magnetic closures<\/li>\n<li>Interior printing for menus or product instructions<\/li>\n<li>Lined inserts to hold bottles, jars, or trays<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Boxes are produced using FDA-compliant materials when food compatibility is required.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Black and White Cardboard Box Designs<\/h2>\n<h3>Simplified Branding with Dual-Color Packaging<\/h3>\n<p>If you want to avoid full-color graphics but still want contrast, our <strong>black and white cardboard box<\/strong> combinations offer a smart solution. These are often used for minimalist branding or high-end products.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>White interior with black outer shell<\/li>\n<li>Black base with white lid or reversed<\/li>\n<li>Neutral tones with gold or silver foil accents<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>This combination works well across fashion, cosmetics, and subscription services. It&#8217;s also a common choice for branding kits and promotional mailing boxes.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Why Order Black Cardboard Boxes Wholesale<\/h2>\n<h3>Bulk Quantities Keep You Prepared<\/h3>\n<p>Ordering black cardboard boxes wholesale helps reduce your cost per unit while ensuring packaging availability when you need it. <strong><a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/cardboard-boxes-by-functionality\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"221\" data-end=\"338\">Cardboard Boxes By Functionality<\/a><\/strong> also give you options to choose designs that match specific packaging needs.<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>Easy to reorder with saved templates<\/li>\n<li>More consistent print and material quality<\/li>\n<li>Reduced inventory gaps and shipping delays<\/li>\n<li>Better price points for growing brands<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>We support businesses that require volume runs or monthly restocks. If you&#8217;re managing various products, explore our Cardboard Boxes By Functionality to select packaging based on application type.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Custom Sizes for Every Product Line<\/h2>\n<h3>From Jewelry to Outerwear Packaging<\/h3>\n<p>We make boxes in sizes ranging from extra-small to <strong>large black cardboard boxes<\/strong> for oversized items or bulk sets. Whether you need a compact container for a ring or a mailer for a hoodie, we can accommodate.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Two-piece boxes with lids<\/li>\n<li>Foldable mailer boxes<\/li>\n<li>Long rectangle and square formats<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>You can also request low-profile boxes for documents or flat products, and taller designs for shipping containers.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>How to Place an Order<\/h2>\n<h3>Step-by-Step Process<\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Submit your required size and quantity<\/li>\n<li>Choose material, box style, and finish<\/li>\n<li>Upload your artwork or get free design help<\/li>\n<li>Review 3D mock-up or flat layout<\/li>\n<li>Approve for production and receive boxes with free shipping<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>Boxes are delivered flat for easy storage and fast assembly on-site.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"229\" data-end=\"275\">Looking for More Color Options in Packaging<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"277\" data-end=\"710\">If you\u2019re managing multiple product lines and want packaging beyond black, we also offer a wide range of printed and tinted boxes in solid colors. These options help you coordinate branding across different categories or product variants. You can explore our full selection of <strong data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"648\"><a class=\"cursor-pointer\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/colored-cardboard-boxes\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"556\" data-end=\"646\">Colored Cardboard Boxes<\/a><\/strong>, available in various finishes, sizes, and structural styles.<\/p>\n<h2>Related Products You Might Be Looking For<\/h2>\n<p>If you&#8217;re packaging by application, browse our full selection under <strong>Cardboard Boxes By Functionality<\/strong>. This section includes boxes designed specifically for:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Shipping and transit<\/li>\n<li>Display and shelf packaging<\/li>\n<li>Food and perishables<\/li>\n<li>E-commerce and mailing<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>You\u2019ll find options to mix and match across your SKUs with a consistent look and reliable construction.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Why Shop Cardboard Boxes for Black Packaging<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Wholesale pricing on <strong>black cardboard packaging<\/strong><\/li>\n<li>Coating options: Gloss, Matte, and Spot UV<\/li>\n<li>High-quality printing for logos and messages<\/li>\n<li>Free layout design and visual proofing<\/li>\n<li>Eco-conscious material options available<\/li>\n<li>Fast production and nationwide delivery<\/li>\n<li>Boxes available in stock and custom styles<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Request a quote today and get started on your Black Cardboard Boxes with Shop Cardboard Boxes.<\/strong><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Need strong, sturdy black cardboard boxes for your products? Look no further. We offer high-quality black cardboard boxes at wholesale prices, with fast turnaround times. Customize your boxes with your logo, branding, and design. Choose from various coating options like gloss, matte, and spot UV. We also offer free design and shipping services. Contact us today.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2347,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[181],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-2237","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-cardboard-boxes-by-functionality","rishi-post","first","instock","shipping-taxable","purchasable","product-type-simple"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.9 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Buy Black Cardboard Boxes And Packaging<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Wholesale black cardboard boxes with fast turnaround times. Choose from various coating options and free design services.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-ima